{#- The day's tasks input (subconscious/day_tasks.py), a projection of objects: every object shows its label of
    this call (`ref`, day_tasks.project) and its data, never its id. Expects agent_input: day, own [entry with ref,
    relies_on_labels, work], situation (subconscious/situation.py, rendered by shared/brain/situation.j2; each concern with its plan
    and cancelled entries, day_tasks.with_concerns), matters (each with `ref`),
    earlier (objects an entry relies on that are not otherwise shown), source_labels, correction. Times local. -#}
{%- set A = agent_input -%}
{%- macro relied(labels, pad) %}{% if labels %}
{{ pad }}relies on: {% for x in labels %}[{{ x }}]{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endmacro -%}
## The day: {{ A.day }}

### Your own entries, and earlier days' entries whose work is still in motion (each stays as it is unless the day now needs it changed)
{% for e in A.own %}- [{{ e.ref }}]{% if e.day != A.day %} (from {{ e.day }}, its work still in motion){% endif %} {{ e.what }} | the assistant: {{ e.assistant_part }} | when: {{ e.when_local }}{% if e.concern_ref %} | serves [{{ e.concern_ref }}]{% endif %} | {{ e.status }}, made {{ e.updated_at | local_time }}: {{ e.why }}{{ relied(e.relies_on_labels, "    ") }}
{% if e.work %}{% with w = e.work, pad = "    " %}{% include 'shared/brain/entry_work.j2' %}{% endwith %}{% endif -%}
{% else %}
(none)
{% endfor %}
{% with s = A.situation %}{% include 'shared/brain/situation.j2' %}{% endwith %}

## What is believed about the household, closest in meaning to the open concerns
{% for b in A.beliefs -%}
- {{ b.statement }}
{% else -%}
(no belief comes close in meaning)
{% endfor %}
{% if A.earlier %}
## Earlier things named above, not shown elsewhere here
{% for x in A.earlier -%}
{% if x.missing is defined %}- [{{ x.ref }}] (no longer stored)
{% elif x.kind == "work" %}{% with w = x.work %}{% include 'shared/brain/past_work.j2' %}{% endwith %}
{% elif x.kind in ("message", "reminder") %}- [{{ x.ref }}] [{{ x.at | local_time }}] {{ x.speaker }}: {{ x.text }}
{% elif x.kind == "concern" %}- [{{ x.ref }}] concern: {{ x.title }} ({{ x.bucket }})
{% elif x.kind == "list_entry" %}- [{{ x.ref }}] an entry on the list of {{ x.entry.day or "a concern" }}: {{ x.entry.what }}; {{ x.entry.decision | replace("_", " ") }}{% if x.entry.when_local %}, {{ x.entry.when_local }}{% endif %}; {{ x.entry.status }}, decided {{ x.entry.updated_at | local_time }}
{% elif x.kind == "brain_matter" %}- [{{ x.ref }}] the brain decided at {{ x.at | local_time }}: {% for r in x.reasons %}{{ r }}{% if not loop.last %} / {% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% elif x.gone_from_schedule is defined %}- [{{ x.ref }}] a line no longer on today's schedule
{% endif -%}
{% endfor %}{% endif %}

{% with matters = A.matters %}{% include 'shared/brain/matters_today.j2' %}{% endwith %}
{% if A.correction %}
## Your previous answer was refused
{{ A.correction }}
{% endif %}
Decide each calendar concern's entry and each concern planner's proposal, and give in entries every change to the
list.
